      </costs>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Decapitation Strike" id="b56f-f335-9f23-dc5e" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="5234-5c48-a06a-e2e1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Decapitation Strike" id="5a17-4323-b322-f5b4" hidden="false">
              <description>Effects
All models with the Chapter (Raven Guard) special rule in a Detachment using this Formation gain the Preferred Enemy (Independent Characters) special rule.


All models in any unit from a Detachment using this formation assigned to a Deep Strike Assault or Flanking Assault gain the Shrouded (5+) special rule for the duration of the Game Turn in which they are deployed to the battlefield.


In missions that use Victory points, an army that includes a Detachment using this Formation gains an additional 2 Victory points for the Slay the Warlord Secondary Objective.


Limitations
A Detachment using this Formation may only include a single Heavy Support choice.
A Detachment using this Formation may not take Fortification choices.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
    </selectionEntry>
